OL,3,GNEWSAPay meant I had to rush my snooker
OL,4,Areturn after cancer ` Carter
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnooker great Ali Carter said he had
OL,7,F"no choice" but to rush back to playing
OL,8,Fdespite the trauma of battling cancer
OL,9,Ftwice in a matter of months.
OL,11,FThe two-time World Snooker Championship
OL,12,Ffinalist was unpaid for almost a year
OL,13,Fwhile sidelined between 2013 and 2014.
OL,15,F"I had to get back and get playing and
OL,16,Fget earning again, that was the
OL,17,Fpressure of life," said Carter, from
OL,18,FChelmsford, Essex.
